# SmolVLA model-specific deps (global base is requirements.txt / requirements.lock).
# Regenerate: tools/lock_model.sh smolvla
#
# Why these exact versions:
# - lerobot 0.4.1 caps transformers<5.0.0 and requires num2words>=0.5.14.
# - lerobot 0.4.1 caps torch<2.8.0; the cu128 build supports Blackwell GPUs.
# - transformers 4.x imports PIL.ImagePalette at module load time.
# - Pillow 11.3.0 (global) stopped eagerly importing ImagePalette; 11.2.1 works.

--extra-index-url https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cu128

